<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken says purchase to help result.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken says purchase to help result.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish commercial bank Handelsbanken said its purchase of Stadshypotek would have a positive effect on its result from 1998.</p>
</text>
